+
+# Cancel bookings
+
+Request: add `cancel(bookingId, at)` to the rental service. It cancels the booking at time `at` and returns
+`{ bookingId, refund }`, the euro cents given back. A cancelled booking no longer holds its equipment
+(`book` and `availability` ignore it) and a booking can only be cancelled once (a second cancel throws, as
+do an unknown id or an invalid `at`).
+
+Refund policy (the request gave none, so this is an assumption to confirm): the whole booking total when
+`at` is before the booking starts, nothing from its start on.
+Implemented in `src/index.ts`; covered by tests in `test/rental.test.ts`.
